WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:17.690
Paulo?

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.240
Paulo? Can you trust me?

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.830
Oh. Oh, God.

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.020
What are you doing?

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:49.140
It's a surprise. Are you ready?

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:55.860
Heh heh heh heh heh.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.700
You're supposed to be in Russia.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.400
Well, they delayed my flight. I mean, I have

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.220
a beautiful idea. Let's get married right

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.430
here. Friends and family are just the two of

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.960
us. Tomorrow, if you want.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.370
Let's do it.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.140
Was that your plan all along?

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.080
When everything eventually fell apart, we

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.090
would just. We would get married up here on

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.140
my rooftop?

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.780
I would marry you under a bridge if I had to.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:29.760
What's going on, Paolo?

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:32.400
I called everywhere.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.200
No one knows anything about our wedding.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.040
Nothing.

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:37.990
Is that what this is about?

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.410
Benita, we have important guests that

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:42.550
require discretion.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:44.800
Our wedding was supposed to be confidential.

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.200
What did you expect to find out without me?

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:47.830
What's going on?

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:48.790
You're lying to me.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:50.650
Why would I lie to you?

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.810
And I trusted you with my daughter.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:54.760
I was getting ready to uproot my entire

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.250
f***ing life for a lie.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.580
I made a few mistakes.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:02.840
And you're still punishing me?

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.160
No, no, no, no, I thought we were past.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.570
I looked into everything.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:07.010
I looked into you.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.810
You looked into me? Yeah.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:10.010
Why would you look into me?

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.210
Why me, Paula?

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:13.070
Why me?

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.370
I'm a journalist. You had to know at some

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:18.800
point, I was gonna start asking questions.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.490
Yeah.

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.440
That's what I love about you.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.600
That man in Italy had a wife.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.830
Who was your patient?

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.390
He wasn't mafia.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.800
He wasn't some stranger.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:31.300
He wasn't an enemy.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.590
What did you do to them?

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.000
What did you do to them?

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.690
There are certain things that you don't want

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.210
to have to tell you. You're giving me no

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:07.530
choice. Without my work, what I do.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.580
Is tied to governments heads of state.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:16.410
Oligarchs. I've been forced to treat some

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.640
very bad people.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.110
And you don't want to go digging in there,

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.730
Benita, because it's dangerous.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.290
It is dangerous for me.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:23.760
It is dangerous for you.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.110
And it's dangerous for Lizzie.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.140
What I'm trying to do is to protect you.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:40.520
Paulo. Paulo, you need to leave.

